identifier: WarmStart
name: Warm Start
abstract: >-
  The game starts in less than half the time: what it works out afresh at
  every start (the expansions' files unpacked, PNG textures converted, what is
  in its small bundles, the parts' drag cubes after a change to the mods) is
  kept from the last one. With Harmony installed, the game's look-ups of
  models, textures and sounds go by a table and the parts' icons are made
  without copying what is thrown away; without it no game code is patched.
author: Ishiaki
$kref: '#/ckan/github/IshiakiZ/ksp-warm-start'
$vref: '#/ckan/ksp-avc'
x_netkan_version_edit: '^[vV]?(?<version>.+)$'
license: CC-BY-4.0
tags:
  - plugin
  - convenience
depends:
  - name: Keystone
recommends:
  - name: Harmony2
install:
  - find: WarmStart
    install_to: GameData
